Package: pxweb2r
Title: Get Data From a PxWeb API v2
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Peter", "Möller", , "larspetermoller@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for fetching data and metadata from a PxWeb API v2, by
    default Statistics Sweden's statistical database. Handles automatic
    chunking of large requests, label values in queries, wildcards,
    "latest period", aggregations, and splitting DeSO and RegSO by
    municipality. Results are returned as tidy tibbles.
